[15:08:08Z]           dmesg  (boot-milestone ring: PORTSW / FTDI console / EHCI HID / block / GUI handoff)
[15:08:08Z]           hexdump <path> [off] [len]  (bounded dump), lsusb  (USB device summary)
[15:08:08Z]           burst  (SCHED-BAL multi-hot-thread burst), simmer  (per-core load animator)
[15:08:08Z]           batmon  (battery snapshot; the platform that has one answers)
